 "prompts": {
  "pip": "Pockle main sound, Pip: a single soft wet bubble pop from a tiny friendly jelly toy creature, round and bubbly with a small high bloop, one short isolated sound, dry close clean recording, gentle natural decay into silence, no speech, no music, no background noise.",
  "fox": "Pockle main sound, Fox: one tiny cheerful yip from a small friendly fox toy, a single light warm high-pitched puppy-like bark, cute and not aggressive, short isolated sound, dry close clean recording, natural decay into silence, no speech, no music, no background noise.",
  "axolotl": "Pockle main sound, Axolotl: a soft watery plop followed by a few small rising bubbles in a glass of water, gentle and cute like a tiny axolotl toy saying hello, short isolated sound, dry close clean recording, natural decay into silence, no speech, no music, no background noise.",
  "firb": "Pockle main sound, Firb: a bright delicate magical shimmer chime with a ringing star-like sparkle, like a tiny evergreen tree sprite twinkling, single short isolated sound, clean close recording, gentle natural ring-out into silence, no melody, no speech, no background noise.",
  "coco": "Pockle main sound, Coco: one short soft warm owl-like hoot chirp, a single rounded low cozy hoo from a small friendly cocoa-cup toy creature, short isolated sound, dry close clean recording, natural decay into silence, no speech, no music, no background noise.",
  "snowy": "Pockle main sound, Snowy: a short happy fast ocarina flourish, three or four airy breathy flute notes rising playfully, like a small friendly snow creature whistling, single isolated phrase, dry close clean recording, natural decay into silence, no backing music, no speech, no background noise.",
  "ginger": "Pockle main sound, Ginger: a short high-pitched cartoon giggle, a quick crisp hee-hee-hee laugh from a small playful gingerbread bear toy, nonverbal, cute and bright, single isolated sound, dry close clean recording, natural decay into silence, no words, no music, no background noise.",
  "reiny": "Pockle main sound, Reiny: a small gentle creature vocalization, a soft warm nasal snuffle and a curious rounded mrrm-hm coo from a tiny friendly reindeer toy, nonverbal, single short isolated sound, dry close clean recording, natural decay into silence, no words, no music, no background noise.",
  "guin": "Pockle main sound, Guin: one short squeaky baby seabird cry, a single cute nasal eep chirp from a small friendly penguin toy, bright and brief, isolated sound, dry close clean recording, natural decay into silence, no speech, no music, no background noise.",
  "bundy": "Pockle main sound, Bundy: a springy cartoon boing bounce, one rubbery wobbling spring jump with a soft rounded low pitch, like a round pudding toy hopping, single short isolated sound, dry close clean recording, natural decay into silence, no speech, no music, no background noise.",
  "wally": "Pockle main sound, Wally: one short soft sonar-like ping with a gentle rising whine, a rounded airy underwater tone like a tiny friendly whale toy calling, single isolated sound, clean close recording, natural decay into silence, no speech, no music, no background noise."
 },
